# The Road to Aht Urhgan (jeuno 91): the trade lists at Prog 1, each set once (the beginner list is the main
# flow's): the intermediate list, the chips, and each of the 27 advancedSingleList items alone (npcUtil.tradeSetInList:
# tradeHasExactly of each in turn). Each: 10069, finished: the trade taken, the mustZone, Prog 3, Timer 8001; Prog set
# back to 1 by a GM. Two coffer keys: nil (tradeHasExactly wants one); an intermediate set at Prog 2 (a GM): nil; the
# chips with a Gray Chip short: nil. Accepted by a GM. The inventory at 40 (storage): the 37 items fit (a fresh char's
# 30 holds the first 30 only, and a trade of an item not held does nothing).
lists LowerJeuno/Faursel/onTrade LowerJeuno/onEventFinish/10069
char zone=LowerJeuno pos=39.5,4.1,-45.2 job=WAR lvl=75
quest Jeuno.TheRoadToAhtUrhgan accepted
charvar Quest[3][91]Prog 1
storage inventory 40
item JadeCryptex
item JadeCryptex
item SilverEngraving
item SilverEngraving
item ThirteenKnotQuipu
item ThirteenKnotQuipu
item CarmineChip
item CyanChip
item GrayChip
